    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1726845509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1726845509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1726845509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/c01708cdbe115ba67f090ca1fbd8ff1a.avif?t=1726845509\" /></span><br><br>Discover a captivating underwater world in Forgotten Waters, a single-player farming and resource management game. Farm, explore, and befriend underwater citizens. Manage resources, engage in combat, and protect your underwater town from hostile sea creatures and lurking enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/831201a64ff10b7a419d9ac90dd79300.avif?t=1726845509\" /></span><br><br><strong>\u2022 Immersive Underwater World:</strong> Dive into a captivating and mysterious underwater realm.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Single-Player Farming:</strong> Experience the joy of farming as you tend to the land, sow seeds, and nurture crops.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Exploration and Friends:</strong> Embark on exciting explorations, uncover hidden secrets, and forge meaningful friendships with the diverse underwater citizens.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Resource Management:</strong> Master the art of resource allocation as you strategically manage your supplies, ensuring the growth and prosperity of your underwater town.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Engaging Combat: </strong>Test your skills in thrilling combat encounters, defending your town against hostile sea creatures and lurking enemies.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Protect Your Town:</strong> Take on the role of a guardian as you safeguard your underwater town from dangers and maintain its well-being in the face of various challenges.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Jellyfish!</strong> Discover all of the jellyfish species, each possessing its own captivating colors and mesmerizing bioluminescence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/96359790b7f17355fbcfb96c21384781.avif?t=1726845509\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/970ff40b0e23c5ef4c2ec6b9a617566b.avif?t=1726845509\" /></span>",
