g>\u2022 Engaging Combat: </strong>Test your skills in thrilling combat encounters, defending your town against hostile sea creatures and lurking enemies.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Protect Your Town:</strong> Take on the role of a guardian as you safeguard your underwater town from dangers and maintain its well-being in the face of various challenges.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Jellyfish!</strong> Discover all of the jellyfish species, each possessing its own captivating colors and mesmerizing bioluminescence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/96359790b7f17355fbcfb96c21384781.avif?t=1726845509\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479370/extras/970ff40b0e23c5ef4c2ec6b9a617566b.avif?t=1726845509\" /></span>",
